{"id":"type-function-range","html":"<section id=\"features\"><h2>题型特征</h2><ul><li><p>已知函数或相关条件，要求在定义域内所有实际能取到的函数值组成的集合。</p><p class=\"cue-example\"><span>例中</span>undefined</p></li><li><p>目标是函数的全部输出，输入可能由解析式、抽象关系、有限集合或指定区间给出。</p><p class=\"cue-example\"><span>例中</span>undefined</p></li><li><p>值域必须同时说明输出不能超出的范围以及范围内输出的可达性，不能只给一个界或某个最值。</p><p class=\"cue-example\"><span>例中</span>undefined</p></li><li><p>换元、周期关系和参数等结构属于选法条件，不能因结构相近就忽略原定义域。</p><p class=\"cue-example\"><span>例中</span>undefined</p></li><li><p>当前开放固定至多二次多项式及其开平方、比例和平移；根式、绝对值及可逆仿射输入关系可换元为至多二次式；可分离为 A+B/Q(x) 的分式保留原式禁取点后逐段取倒数。全实数域且原分母无实根的二次分式可用方程有实根法；抽象函数在准确域和值域已知、仿射新输入完整覆盖原定义域时，可用换元求值域法传递值域。有限输入逐一代入后收集不同输出；全实数域的周期函数与一次项之和，在已知一个完整周期区间的准确值域、目标域可由该区间的整数平移完整覆盖时，可用整段平移求值域法。</p><p class=\"cue-example\"><span>例中</span>undefined</p></li></ul><div class=\"feature-confuse\"><p class=\"feature-tag\">别和它混淆</p><ul><li><span>要求原式有意义的全部输入</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"problem_type\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/type-function-domain/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>具体函数的定义域问题</a></li><li><span>只求指定输入的输出或函数值组合</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"problem_type\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/type-function-evaluation/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>求函数值</a></li></ul></div></section><section id=\"choose\"><h2>怎么选方法</h2><div class=\"choose-rule\"><p>用<a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/rule-function-range-method/\">求函数值域的选法判断</a>来选：满足哪一条，就可以用对应的方法；几条同时满足时，挑顺手的。</p><ul class=\"branch-list\"><li><span>常数商、至多一次余项和至多二次分母；常数余项求分母范围，一次余项通过换元与对勾函数等中间函数求范围，并合并合法零点输出。</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-fraction-split-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分式分离求值域法</a></li><li><span>原定义域为实数全域，原分母为无实根二次式，分子至多二次。</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-equation-real-root-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>方程有实根法</a></li></ul></div><h3>可选用的方法</h3><div class=\"choose-methods\"><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-finite-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>枚举法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>非空有限输入集合和可验证的函数规则。</p><p>确定有限的合法输入，逐一代入，收集并去重得到全部输出。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-direct-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>直接求值域法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>原始函数、其有效输入域和有来源的基本变换。</p><p>先确定定义域，依据一次函数与平方根性质，经过比例和平移得到全部实际输出。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-quadratic-interval-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>二次函数区间值域法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>原始函数、其有效输入域和有来源的基本变换。</p><p>先确定定义域，结合开口、顶点与区间端点求全部输出，并检查端点可达性。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-substitution-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>换元求值域法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>具体函数或已知定义域和值域的抽象函数，以及新输入关系与输入限制。</p><p>先确定原定义域，再建立新变量的准确范围，将函数完全改写后求值域。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-fraction-split-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分式分离求值域法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>分离后商为常数、余项分子至多一次、分母至多二次的固定系数分式及准确输入范围。</p><p>保留原定义域，分离常数；求分母或对勾函数的范围，再取倒数、还原并合并零点分支。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-equation-real-root-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>方程有实根法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>全实数域、原分母全域非零的固定有理系数二次分式。</p><p>将输出值转为关于输入的方程，分别判断二次、一次及常量方程有解的条件。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-translation-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>整段平移求值域法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>周期函数 g、f(x)=ax+g(x)，以及一个周期长的完整段上的准确值域。</p><p>已知某一完整周期段上的值域；把这段按整数次平移铺满目标输入范围，再把各段值域合并。</p></article></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>说明与题例</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 顶点在闭区间内</h3><p class=\"problem\">求 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x^2-2x+2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,3]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span> 上的值域。</p><ol><li><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=(x-1)^2+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，</span>顶点横坐标 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\in[0,3]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>。</span></li><li><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span>，</span><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，</span><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(3)=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span>，</span>值域为 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>。</span></li></ol><p class=\"source\">函数的概念 Q3</p></article></section>"}
